hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"83","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main tere ilm ke waste bhalai mangta hun, teri qudrat ke waste taqat mangta hun aur tere bade fazl se mangta hun; Tu hi qadir hai, main qadir nahin; Tu hi janta hai, main nahin janta; Tu hi ghaib ka janne wala hai. Ae Allah! Tu janta ho yeh kaam mere deen, rozi aur kaam ke anjam mein mere liye behtar hai—to mere liye muqaddar kar de, aasan kar de, is mein barkat de. Aur Tu janta ho yeh kaam mere deen, rozi aur kaam ke anjam mein mere liye bura hai—to use mujhse pher de, mujhe bhi us se pher de; jahan bhi bhalai ho mere liye muqaddar kar de, phir mujhe us par razi kar de. [Istikhara ki dua: do rakat nafl ke baad padhe; yeh kaam ki jagah hajat ka zikr kare]"
